<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AMBICODE &mdash; page closed</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/page.css">
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="panel">
<h1>The page is closed.</h1>
<p>The local server has stopped. Nothing further was published, and the saved review is untouched on disk.</p>
<p>You can close this tab. To look at the review again, run this in your terminal for a fresh link:</p>
<pre class="argv"><%= it.reopenCommand %></pre>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
